---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoStringRunesDemo from '../demos/GoStringRunesDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gsrun-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: UTF-8 byte array vs runes (s[i], slicing bug, for range)" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng tương tác: Mảng byte UTF-8 vs ký tự rune (lỗi cắt s[:4] và for range)">
    <GoStringRunesDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Step through how "Phở 🍜" occupies 10 UTF-8 bytes behind a 16-byte string header, why s[0:4] splits the multi-byte 'ở' rune in half, and how for range walks rune boundaries with zero allocations.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm từng bước xem chuỗi "Phở 🍜" nằm trên 10 byte UTF-8 phía sau header 16 byte ra sao, vì sao s[0:4] cắt đứt đôi chữ 'ở' và cách vòng lặp for range nhảy đúng ranh giới ký tự với 0 lần cấp phát.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gsrun-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gsrun-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gsrun-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gsrun .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gsrun .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gsrun .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gsrun .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gsrun-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gsrun-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gsrun-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gsrun-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gsrun-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gsrun-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gsrun-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .gsrun-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gsrun-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }

  .gsrun-mem { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .gsrun-mem-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .gsrun-bytes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(10, minmax(56px, 1fr)); gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .gsrun-cell {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2px;
    padding: 6px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
  }
  .gsrun-cell.is-ok { border-color: rgb(21, 128, 61); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gsrun-cell.is-ok { border-color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gsrun-cell.is-bad { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gsrun-idx { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gsrun-hex { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .gsrun-ch { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; }
</style>
